    {
      "key_point_id": "kp_fragment_controls",
      "statement": "Compute common-fragment interaction/distortion and state explicitly surface/isodensity/gauge for ESP. A gas-phase ion-solvent Eb and neutral salt-cluster interaction are separate quantities. Core rows: PM, BM, TFPM, TFBM. Recompute binding_kJ_mol, interaction_kJ_mol, distortion_kJ_mol, dipole_D, ESP_O_eV, RESP_O_e from the submitted linked raw outputs and numeric tables. No narrative-only control or reused old scalar receives endpoint credit.",
      "expected": "Compute common-fragment interaction/distortion and state explicitly surface/isodensity/gauge for ESP. A gas-phase ion-solvent Eb and neutral salt-cluster interaction are separate quantities. Core rows: PM, BM, TFPM, TFBM. Recompute binding_kJ_mol, interaction_kJ_mol, distortion_kJ_mol, dipole_D, ESP_O_eV, RESP_O_e from the submitted linked raw outputs and numeric tables. No narrative-only control or reused old scalar receives endpoint credit.",
